  "releaseNotes": "## v3.73.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v3.72.0:\n\n- [minor] Publish the chord matcher, interface scale, linear colour edits, prompt answers, overwrite confirmation and crop guides (#628) ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))\n- [patch] Stop ValueSlider reporting a change on held frames that move nothing ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
